{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22550","headline":"自城东至以诗代书戏招李六拾遗崔二十六先辈 · 白居易","name":"自城东至以诗代书戏招李六拾遗崔二十六先辈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青门走马趁心期，惆怅归来已校迟。\n应过唐昌玉蘂後，犹当崇敬牡丹时。\n暂游还忆崔先辈，欲醉先邀李拾遗。\n尚残半月芸香俸，不作归粮作酒赀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22550.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22550","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}